OL,3,AMNEK cancels tour over lack of ticket
OL,4,Asales and high production costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FMNEK has cancelled his upcoming tour
OL,7,Fdue to a lack of ticket sales and the
OL,8,Fshow not being "ready to the standard"
OL,9,Fhe wanted.
OL,11,FThe Grammy-nominated artist, who has
OL,12,Fworked with the likes of Beyonce, Zara
OL,13,FLarsson and Madonna, was due to start a
OL,14,Frun of shows for his latest album
OL,15,FBulldozer!! next month.
OL,17,FIn a statement shared on Instagram, the
OL,18,F31-year-old said he joins other artists
OL,19,Fwho have cancelled shows recently as a
OL,20,Fresult of "high production costs" and
OL,21,F"over-ambitious planning".
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
